From 07850fb32a3a3c32d443fdad47fa5d7b4fba72e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Contributor <contributor@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 07:22:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore(lint): ratchet ruff against a committed baseline
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

CONTRIBUTING has always listed `uv run ruff check src/ tests/` as a PR
requirement, but that command has never passed: the tree carries ~1.7k
violations of the declared rule set, and nothing enforced it — CI runs mypy
and pytest but not ruff, and the pre-commit hook only type-checks.

It is not a version-drift problem either. ruff 0.8.0 reports 2095 violations
on this tree and 0.15.2 reports 2106, so no pin rescues the command. The two
direct fixes were measured and rejected:

- Autofixing everything now rewrites 291 files for I001+F401 alone, which
  buries any real change in mechanical churn.
- Ignoring the ~48 rules that currently fire would empty the rule set of
  meaning and delete the signal the project says it wants.

So ruff gets the treatment mypy already got here (699 errors -> strict clean):
a committed per-file, per-rule baseline that is only allowed to go down.
scripts/ruff_gate.py fails CI when a PR raises any count, reports removals
without failing on them, and new files start at zero.

Two supporting changes:

- Bound ruff to >=0.15,<0.16. A baseline is only meaningful against a known
  rule set, and a floating >=0.8 let every `uv lock` move the number.
- Exempt Alembic's migrations/versions/ via per-file-ignores (382 violations,
  mostly the UP007/UP035 that alembic's own template emits). A migration that
  already ran against a database is a historical record, not a reformat target.

Also corrects the frontend row of the README tech-stack table: package.json
pins next ~15.5.12, not Next.js 14.

Verification:
  uv run python scripts/ruff_gate.py    -> no new violations (1724 total)
  uv run mypy src/fim_one/              -> 437 files clean
  uv run pytest -m "not docker"         -> 4166 passed, 2 skipped
  python3 scripts/check_md_links.py     -> 293 files clean
